      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        176,
        144
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sender whitelist\nThis orchestrator only holds the 3 triggers + the two sub-workflow calls. The actual drafting/booking logic (and the sender whitelist) now lives in **Gmail Assistant — Drafting**.\n\nTo add/remove a tracked sender: open **Gmail Assistant — Drafting** and edit the **Tracked Senders** data table (used by its \"Get Tracked Senders\" node).\n\nColumns:\n- matchPatterns: sender email(s), comma-separated for aliases\n- senderName: display name used in the signature/prompt\n- active: true/false (set false to pause without deleting)\n- notes: tone/language instructions for the draft\n\nThe recap logic lives in **Gmail Assistant — Recap**.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
